2. Domain Registration, DNS, and Security Configuration

Documentation covering domain registration, DNS configuration, Cloudflare, and security configuration required to make the website publicly accessible.

Focus: DNS, networking, Cloudflare, HTTPS, web security

Documentation:
https://www.sushantadk.com/SupportingDocuments/domainRegistrationAndDNSConfiguration.html

3. Building a Server

Documentation of the process of building and configuring a server from the ground up. This one probably belongs in Projects rather than Supporting Documents.

Focus: Linux, hardware, system administration, server configuration

Documentation:
https://www.sushantadk.com/SupportingDocuments/buildingAServer.html

