ABOUT

This repository is my attempt to build a personal, hands-on, and free learning environment while documenting the process for others who wish to do the same. My personal website and server infrastructure provide a practical environment for learning Linux administration, networking, web deployment, automation, and security. My production server is a repurposed Redmi Note 10 Pro running postmarketOS, my backup server is an old HP Pavilion laptop running Debian 13, my personal laptop runs Ubuntu, and my attack machine runs Kali Linux.

If a project is mentioned on my website/repository but is not included in the README, it is probably because the project has just started and is incomplete. 

Visit my website at: https://www.sushantadk.com/
